ackages installed by the workspace."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Releasing"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Releases are driven by Changesets. Ship every\nuser-visible change with a changeset and commit it alo"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"n by Changesets. Ship every\nuser-visible change with a changeset and commit it alongside the change:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Changesets maintains one draft release pull request containing all pending changesets. Keep that\npul"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"l request open while changes accumulate. When the complete release is ready, review the combined\nver"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"sion and changelog, mark the pull request as ready, and merge it to publish the release. Changes\ntha"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"t do not affect a published package do not need a changeset."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Write release-level highlights and upgrade notes in `.changeset/.release-notes/next.md`, using\nheadi"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ng level 3 (`###`) or lower. The version script prepends that Markdown to the generated package\nchan"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"gelog, so the draft release pull request and final GitHub Release show the same notes before the\nCha"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"ngesets list. The release pull request consumes and clears the file for the next release."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Community"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Wechat Group"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Apache-2.0"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
